  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/03/IMG_0239.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>El resturante Palmito ha acogio el s&aacute;bado 28 de febrero la V Gala del Bou&nbsp;en Onda (la primera fue en 2009)&nbsp;en la que se han entregado <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=46304\" target=\"_blank\">los premios de la Pascua Taurina</a>&nbsp;de 2014,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/03/IMG_0236.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>distinciones y premios a barrios, y mejores toros de las pe&ntilde;as en Fira del a&ntilde;o pasado.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galabouonda15/img_0122.jpg\" alt=\"img_0122\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galabouonda15/img_0124.jpg\" alt=\"img_0124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galabouonda15/img_0127.jpg\" alt=\"img_0127\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galabouonda15/img_0128.jpg\" alt=\"img_0128\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galabouonda15/img_0130.jpg\" alt=\"img_0130\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galabouonda15/img_0132.jpg\" alt=\"img_0132\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galabouonda15/img_0137.jpg\" alt=\"img_0137\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/galabouonda15/img_0138.jpg\" alt=\"img_0138\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-